{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\chuanle song\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Microsoft\\\\WindowsApps\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"Get-Content -Raw 'pipeline/codex_memory.md'\"","aggregated_output":"# AdaRES_project Research Memory\n\n## Goal And Phase\n- Phase 1 ScanRefer mIoU >= 0.515 unmet; Phase 2 pending. Server-2 GPUs 0/1 only, one task per GPU; server-6 excluded.\n- Released SPFormer sparse-UNet backbone and project decoder. No validation tuning of thresholds, temperatures, weights, feature sets or fixed 30-epoch protocol.\n- `research_on_capacity_gap=true`; admission hard gates: diagnosis, controls, native backward, resources, independence and goal constraints.\n\n## Champion And Baseline\n- B1 0.5020 mIoU, Acc@0.25 0.610, Acc@0.5 0.553, spmIoU 0.467.\n- B4-E30 champion 0.5094, Acc@0.25 0.608, Acc@0.5 0.562, spmIoU 0.474 at epoch 27; target gap 0.0056. Epoch-20 optimizer/scheduler continuation, not a fresh matched control.\n- B4-E30 checkpoint: `/bak_home/songcl/Project/AdaRES_project/AdaRES_checkpoints/adares_b4_query_competition_res/20260921_210214/best.pth`.\n\n## Active Hypotheses\n- None admitted or pending. Fixed 16-scene B4 cohort retains large oracle-mask versus selected-mask gap (0.87316 vs 0.49186), but no new reliable inference-time confidence mechanism passed gates.\n\n## Closed Or Failed Directions\n- B0 0.333; B2-E30 0.5058; B3 0.5014; B4 at 20 epochs 0.5070; B5 0.5030; C1-E30 0.5008; C2-E30 0.5014; F4 0.5060; D1 0.5080; H5 0.5061. No tuning-only, seed-repeat or extension-only successors.\n- G1 closed 30/30, best 0.4980, -0.0114 vs B4-E30. Fixed 16-scene top-1 0.47072 vs B4 0.49186; oracle 0.83308 vs B4 0.87316. No metric-target weight/label scan.\n- E1/F1/F2/F3 and H1-H4, J1/J2, K1/K2, L1/L2, M1/M2 rejected on their specific bounded native diagnoses; see research_work.json for stable IDs and hashes.\n- N1 indicator/mask gradient interference mixed at trained B4 checkpoint (four batch cosines -0.868, -0.079, +0.194, -0.194). Detach-only is ablation; RNG-controlled one-parameter step separation ~8e-7 mask loss. Rejected.\n- N2 same-referent selection inconsistency observed with oracle grouping, but language-nearest grouping same-object only 121/441 and mask-overlap grouping 171/354. Rejected, no validation threshold scan.\n- N3 distinct-target selected-mask collisions 6/365 native training pairs across 64 scenes. Collision-only loss rejected as sparse.\n- O1 fixed first/last content-token masking: validation selected mIoU 0.49186 to 0.48429/0.49538 (441 expressions); train 0.83083 to 0.80476/0.81930 (455). Error association confounded by semantic-changing intervention. Rejected; no token/weight scan.\n- O2 whole-2D-feature removal on 16 train scenes: 422/455 query flips, selected mIoU 0.83083 to 0.28600; broad distribution shift, not error-specific. Rejected.\n\n## Running And Queue\n- Prepared 2026-09-26 18:47 +08:00 monitor: no active/waiting/claiming tasks, capacity 2/2 vacant, candidate budget 2. Targeted GPU query at 18:50 showed GPU0/1 0% and 1 MiB each before probes. No admission, commit, sync, dispatch or manual queue mutation.\n- `research_work.json` contains rejected O1/O2 and bounded design-cycle stop reason with hashed evidence and concrete resume condition.\n\n## Open Questions And Risks\n- No pending questions in prepared manifest. Active queries, full-run latency and peak memory remain unmeasured for key variants; G1 terminal auxiliary best metrics unavailable.\n- Native probes used read-only server-2 code under `/tmp`, key SSH and `adares_project` environment; local Python lacks PyTorch. O1/O2 are inference-only, not native backward or training-resource gates. Fixed validation cohort is observational.\n- Global hypothesis exhaustion is not claimed. Resume on an independently justified, inference-available mechanism with a native matched test and six gates, not renamed/tuned variants.\n\n## Last Tick\n- 2026-09-26 19:05 +08:00 design: prepared monitor/goal preflight used once, never rerun. O1 validation/train and O2 train native counterfactuals with repeat controls tested and rejected. Decision logged. Both project GPU slots left unqueued.\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
