{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_22","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\chuanle song\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Microsoft\\\\WindowsApps\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"Get-Content -Raw 'pipeline/reports/summary_20260926-190600.md'\"","aggregated_output":"================================================================================\n  Research Pipeline Report - AdaRES_project\n  2026-09-26 19:06 Asia/Shanghai (design tick)\n================================================================================\n\n## 0. Goal Status\n| Target | Champion | Gap | Phase |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| ScanRefer mIoU >= 0.5150 | AdaRES-B4-E30 0.5094 | 0.0056 | 1, not reached; Phase 2 pending |\n\nB1 baseline 0.5020; champion gain +0.0074. Prepared monitor and goal preflight succeeded once and were not rerun.\n\n## 1. GPU Overview\n| Server | GPU | Util | Memory Used | Process / Assignment |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---|\n| server-2 | 0 | 0% at 18:50, before probes | 1 MiB at 18:50 | no project task assigned; O1/O2 probes completed |\n| server-2 | 1 | 0% at 18:50, before probes | 1 MiB at 18:50 | no project task assigned |\n\nNo current GPU idleness is inferred from earlier targeted readings. Server-6 excluded.\n\n## 2. Running Experiments\n| ID | Config | Server | GPU | Epoch | Best mIoU | Acc@50 | spmIOU | No-Impr | Status |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| - | - | - | - | - | - | - | - | - | none |\n\n## 3. Queue Status\n| Position | ID | Config | Status | Depends On | Server |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| - | - | - | no waiting or claiming tasks | - | - |\n\nActive capacity: 0 active (0 running, 0 claiming, 0 waiting) / 2 target, NEED MORE; candidate budget 2. Neither O1 nor O2 passed admission gates.\n\n## 4. This Tick's Actions\n- Ran O1 fixed content-token perturbation on 16 validation and 16 training scenes with unchanged-input repeat controls. Validation selected mIoU 0.49186 to 0.48429/0.49538; train 0.83083 to 0.80476/0.81930. Intervention changes language semantics.\n- Ran independent O2 global appearance-removal probe on 16 training scenes with repeat control: 422/455 query flips, selected mIoU 0.83083 to 0.28600. Rejected as broad distribution shift.\n- Preserved raw native probes, analysis, motivation review, design, hashed research ledger and decision. No candidate implementation, admission receipt, sync, dispatch or queue mutation. No pending questions in prepared snapshot.\n- Pruned summaries older than 24 hours. Resume condition: independently justified inference-available metric-aligned mechanism with semantic-preserving paired native control and all six gates.\n\n## 5. Decisions Made\n- 2026-09-26 19:05 `route_change`: reject O1/O2 and leave server-2 GPU0/1 unqueued. See `pipeline/decisions/20260926-190529_route_change.md`.\n- The two bounded executable routes for this cycle are exhausted; global scientific exhaustion is not claimed.\n\n================================================================================\n  Next scheduled tick: approximately 2026-09-26 19:47 Asia/Shanghai\n================================================================================\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
